{"4331180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I Don't Wanna Be Fried", "steam_appid": 4331180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Don’t Wanna Be Fried is a <u>hide-and-seek party game</u> where one player becomes the hunter and the rest are chickens trying to avoid being caught!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of unique maps, use interactive objects, customize your matches, and unleash unique abilities to create hilarious and chaotic moments with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Farmer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must eliminate all the chickens before the match timer runs out. He has access to unique abilities to track the chickens’ positions or blur their screens, throw attraction grenades, and stretch his neck to gain a higher vantage point. All of this is combined with special interactive objects unique to each map, such as dividing the map into zones or turning off the lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Chickens</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission is clear: hide from the hunter and do everything they can to mess with him and ruin his hunt. Their small size allows them to sneak into tight spaces, blend into the environment, or wear disguises. They also have special abilities such as a dash or the ability to throw explosive eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Hide-and-seek</strong></u><strong>:</strong> Classic mode with permadeath and round-based respawns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>INFECTION</strong></u><strong>:</strong> When a chicken is caught, it transforms into another hunter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Matches:</strong> Change the rules, tweak character size and speed, adjust match time, or switch up the hunter’s weapon for ultimate chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Objects:</strong> Every map has different objects to interact with—costumes, closets, drawers, switches, electricity, and teleporting toilets!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Don’t Wanna Be Fried is a <u>hide-and-seek party game</u> where one player becomes the hunter and the rest are chickens trying to avoid being caught!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of unique maps, use interactive objects, customize your matches, and unleash unique abilities to create hilarious and chaotic moments with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Farmer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Must eliminate all the chickens before the match timer runs out. He has access to unique abilities to track the chickens’ positions or blur their screens, throw attraction grenades, and stretch his neck to gain a higher vantage point. All of this is combined with special interactive objects unique to each map, such as dividing the map into zones or turning off the lights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Chickens</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their mission is clear: hide from the hunter and do everything they can to mess with him and ruin his hunt. Their small size allows them to sneak into tight spaces, blend into the environment, or wear disguises. They also have special abilities such as a dash or the ability to throw explosive eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Hide-and-seek</strong></u><strong>:</strong> Classic mode with permadeath and round-based respawns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>INFECTION</strong></u><strong>:</strong> When a chicken is caught, it transforms into another hunter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Matches:</strong> Change the rules, tweak character size and speed, adjust match time, or switch up the hunter’s weapon for ultimate chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Objects:</strong> Every map has different objects to interact with—costumes, closets, drawers, switches, electricity, and teleporting toilets!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Play with up to 6 friends in this party game packed with humor and chaos. Hide, prank, and annoy the hunter to avoid being taken down!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4331180/f75b58e9cbe9b837000fb2f1534508f1d72d5898/header.jpg?t=1771427079", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4331180/9fe77eb514305995f82c93fd825b2852bb3e0e5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771427079", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4331180/9fe77eb514305995f82c93fd825b2852bb3e0e5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771427079", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600@ 3.1 GHz or AMD R5 1600X @ 3.5 GHz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 600 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storag